# The phone's scenarios that pass on mobile-ljos, one id per line.
# `cargo test -p hal_c2_mobile --test features` fails when one of them stops
# passing; `-- --raise` adds the ones that newly pass. Never remove a line to
# make a run pass: fix the regression.
mobile/pairing-and-environments.feature: A link that is not a pairing link is refused before any environment is paired
mobile/pairing-and-environments.feature: A pairing link opened from outside the app fills the pairing form without pairing
mobile/pairing-and-environments.feature: A session the phone cannot save is not paired with
mobile/pairing-and-environments.feature: A spent or wrong pairing token is refused
mobile/pairing-and-environments.feature: An unreachable address reports that the environment cannot be reached
mobile/pairing-and-environments.feature: First launch with no environments invites the user to add one
mobile/pairing-and-environments.feature: Pasting a pairing link adds the environment
mobile/pairing-and-environments.feature: The user pairs with a link opened from outside the app
